# Local UI and password corrections — 2026-10-13

Status: IN PROGRESS. Application authority: /root. User reported the malformed
sidebar section switcher in the running local Admin portal, then explicitly
requested changing the password minimum from 12 to 8 characters.

## Approved scope

- Hide the section switcher when the current section is the only destination
  and there are no other company-context choices. Keep the confirmed internal
  switcher for multiple accessible sections or company choices. Fix its styling
  consistently in Admin, Realization, Financing and Insurance without changing
  permissions, company-selection sequencing, section memory or page routes.
- Change the password minimum from 12 to 8 characters in the authoritative
  identity validation and all affected frontend forms/help/errors. Preserve
  existing maximum length, hashing, authentication and unrelated policy.
- Preserve the running local application, reset database and admin account.
  No data reset, new credentials, production operation or remote push.

